# Shared Blood, environment variable TEMPLATE (safe to commit; contains no secrets).
#
# Local development: copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in real values there.
# `.env.local` is git-ignored, so nothing you put in it can reach version control.
#
# Production: set these in the hosting provider's project settings, NOT in a file.
#
# Module 25.8 established NO_REQUIRED_RUNTIME_SECRET: the site builds and serves
# correctly with no secret configured at all. Anything added below that is a
# secret must be reviewed before launch (Module 26 §9).

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# REQUIRED IN PRODUCTION
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# The final canonical HTTPS origin of the site. Used for metadataBase, canonical
# links, Open Graph URLs and alternate-language links.
#
# Module 26 §9/§27: in production this MUST be the real domain over https, with
# no trailing slash. It must NOT remain http://localhost:3000, and it must not
# be a *.vercel.app preview origin on final canonical production pages.
#
# Local development value:
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000
# Production value (example shape):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://sharedblood.org

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOT CURRENTLY USED
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Supabase is not active. No Supabase client exists in the codebase, and the
# site requires no database. Module 26 §9 directs that these NOT be configured
# unless a future approved module activates Supabase, so they are left
# commented out deliberately rather than set to empty strings.
#
# When that module arrives, note the split:
#   - NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are compiled into the browser bundle and are public.
#     The ANON key is public by design; it is protected by row-level security,
#     not by concealment.
#   - The SERVICE ROLE key is a real secret. It must be server-only, must NEVER
#     carry a NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix, and must never be committed.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
